WEBVTT

00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:16.090
I pray that the happiness you gave me

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:20.520
is returned to you many times over.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.230
Yuito, Kasane...

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:25.900
I love you.

00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:30.820
Mother.

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:34.950
That's weird.

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:37.030
Wakana returned to her own time.

00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:40.660
But the Kunad Gate is still there.

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:42.370
It can't be!

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:45.420
Yuito!

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:48.500
Yuito, are you all right?

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:51.300
Let's head back so he can get some rest.

00:00:57.760 --> 00:00:59.470
Yuito?

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:06.850
Yuito.

00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:08.310
You all right?

00:01:08.310 --> 00:01:09.690
Yeah.

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:50.290
"Brothers"

00:02:56.630 --> 00:02:57.800
They're gone.

00:02:57.800 --> 00:03:01.430
"Intrusion Detected"

00:03:01.720 --> 00:03:05.220
Looks like the Search Team is on the move.

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:06.810
That was close.

00:03:06.810 --> 00:03:10.560
I'm surprised they didn't try
to nab us sooner.

00:03:10.560 --> 00:03:15.400
That's because I altered their database
the last time I hacked in.

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:17.440
I set your status to "apprehended."

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:19.650
Since they couldn't find us,

00:03:19.650 --> 00:03:23.620
I bet they went through the list
of probable locations again.

00:03:24.740 --> 00:03:27.370
Yuito. All better now?

00:03:27.370 --> 00:03:29.700
Yeah, don't worry about me.

00:03:30.960 --> 00:03:35.380
All the entanglements are unraveled now?

00:03:35.380 --> 00:03:37.800
All those we detected.

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:43.010
Eleven years ago, 50 years in the future,
and Yakumo Sumeragi's time.

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:44.510
We unraveled them all.

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:49.350
Huh? What does Yakumo Sumeragi's
time have to do with this?

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:53.480
We witnessed Yakumo's assassination,

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:56.150
and I believe that created
an entanglement.

00:03:56.150 --> 00:04:00.280
What are you talking about?
Yakumo wasn't assassinated.

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:03.280
Yeah, I never heard anything like that.

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:05.740
They didn't teach it in History.

00:04:05.740 --> 00:04:08.280
We don't really understand, either.

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:10.160
But we saw it.

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:14.000
Karen killed Yakumo Sumeragi
right before our eyes.

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:16.750
What?!

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:22.340
Karen used Arahabaki and the
Red Strings to travel through time.

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:26.140
So you're saying you traveled
to Yakumo's time?

00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:30.430
Are you sure it was Yakumo
and Karen you saw?

00:04:30.430 --> 00:04:32.060
I'm sure of it.

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:35.600
He had the same mask
that the legends mention.

00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:37.020
A mask?

00:04:38.270 --> 00:04:39.320
A mask!

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:43.110
Of course, he was wearing a mask!
That explains it!

00:04:43.110 --> 00:04:47.780
Kagero, we can't read your mind.
Hurry up and explain.

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:49.780
Oh, right.

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:54.210
You know why Yakumo wore that mask, right?

00:04:54.210 --> 00:04:57.130
He was seriously injured in an accident.

00:04:57.130 --> 00:05:02.590
After he put that mask on,
he stopped going out in public.

00:05:02.590 --> 00:05:06.590
Rumor has it, he became
a totally different person.

00:05:06.590 --> 00:05:08.800
A different person?

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:10.390
Are you saying...

00:05:10.390 --> 00:05:14.600
Karen traveled from the future,
assassinated the real Yakumo,

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:18.360
and then put on his mask
so he could take his place?

00:05:18.360 --> 00:05:20.570
So then Karen is Yakumo?

00:05:20.570 --> 00:05:23.530
Does that mean Karen is Yuito's ancestor?

00:05:23.530 --> 00:05:25.610
No, that's not possible.

00:05:25.610 --> 00:05:29.990
After all, Yakumo already fathered
a child before he was injured.

00:05:29.990 --> 00:05:33.410
But why would Karen do such a thing?

00:05:33.410 --> 00:05:39.000
Does it matter? Bottom line is we have
to do something about the Kunad Gate.

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:41.590
If what you're saying is true,

00:05:41.590 --> 00:05:46.260
there's an entanglement in Yakumo's time
at the point where Karen arrived.

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:47.130
Most likely.

00:05:47.130 --> 00:05:49.300
So you just have to unravel it?

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:53.060
The problem is we never
found that entanglement.

00:05:53.060 --> 00:05:55.480
So what are we supposed to do?

00:05:56.520 --> 00:06:00.520
Wakana was the only one who could
unravel her own entanglement.

00:06:00.520 --> 00:06:05.490
I see. So my brother has to
unravel his own entanglement.

00:06:05.490 --> 00:06:08.410
Yeah, that about sums it up.

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:11.240
We'll have to take Karen
to the Chronos Terminal

00:06:11.240 --> 00:06:14.370
and have him unravel his entanglement.

00:06:14.370 --> 00:06:17.620
You really think he'd do that?

00:06:17.620 --> 00:06:21.290
Wataru, can you identify
Karen's present location?

00:06:21.290 --> 00:06:24.800
I've tried but have had zero luck so far.

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:29.760
I might know where Karen is.

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:33.680
Remember that conversation?

00:06:33.680 --> 00:06:36.600
Yakumo Sumeragi yet lives!

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:38.180
He's alive?

00:06:38.180 --> 00:06:41.310
He sleeps in Suoh, deep underground.

00:06:41.310 --> 00:06:45.820
At this very moment, he slumbers
as he awaits his day of vengeance.

00:06:45.820 --> 00:06:48.360
Suoh, deep underground...

00:06:48.360 --> 00:06:50.910
If I had to guess where
Yakumo Sumeragi was,

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:54.120
I'd say the Sumeragi Mausoleum.

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:57.000
But it's such a tourist trap.

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.750
What do you think, Yuito?

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:01.710
It's your family's tomb.

00:07:01.710 --> 00:07:04.920
I've never gone inside.

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:08.260
But maybe my brother knows more.

00:07:08.260 --> 00:07:12.800
Do you suppose the chief knows
Karen might be Yakumo Sumeragi?

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:13.640
"Kaito Sumeragi"

00:07:13.640 --> 00:07:15.100
"Kaito Sumeragi"

00:07:13.640 --> 00:07:15.100
I don't know.

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:17.810
"Kaito Sumeragi"

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:17.810
I haven't seen my brother
since things went south.

00:07:17.810 --> 00:07:22.690
The chief has been stripped of his
authority and confined to his home.

00:07:24.150 --> 00:07:29.900
So he was forced to take responsibility
after the public learned of his cover-up.

00:07:29.900 --> 00:07:32.070
In other words, he was scapegoated.

00:07:32.070 --> 00:07:32.950
"No Connection"

00:07:32.070 --> 00:07:32.950
In other words, he was scapegoated.

00:07:33.570 --> 00:07:35.370
We can't get through.

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:44.040
Suoh is in chaos.
The time to strike is now.

00:07:44.040 --> 00:07:47.750
But the Kunad Gate poses a problem.

00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:51.550
We can deal with that
after we deal with Suoh.

00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:54.970
This is no time to be
arguing among ourselves.

00:07:57.100 --> 00:07:58.390
Yuito?

00:08:29.920 --> 00:08:31.550
Don't cry.

00:08:31.550 --> 00:08:34.720
You need to learn how
to take care of yourself.

00:08:36.390 --> 00:08:41.390
We Sumeragis can't just depend on others.

00:08:41.390 --> 00:08:46.190
We must always be ready and
able to walk on our own two feet.

00:08:46.190 --> 00:08:50.530
For the sake of our nation, New Himuka,

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:52.940
you must be strong, Yuito!

00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:07.670
Fubuki?

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:15.590
A message from my brother.

00:09:15.590 --> 00:09:15.880
"Kikuchiba"

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:18.180
"Kikuchiba"

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:18.180
He wants me to come alone.

00:09:18.180 --> 00:09:19.050
It's too dangerous!

00:09:19.050 --> 00:09:20.890
It might be a trap.

00:09:20.890 --> 00:09:25.480
Yuito, the chief was after your power.

00:09:28.400 --> 00:09:34.740
Your brain has a special
form of gravikinesis,

00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:37.360
and we must have it.

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:41.410
We will use your power
to move the Extinction Belt.

00:09:41.410 --> 00:09:46.040
It is time to open the way to
the moon and exact our vengeance.

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:50.170
I don't have the power
to move the Extinction Belt!

00:09:50.170 --> 00:09:54.510
You can if we use the brains of
the entire nation connected via SAS.

00:09:54.510 --> 00:09:58.720
You're insane! Only psionics users
can withstand an SAS connection!

00:09:58.720 --> 00:10:00.760
They need not withstand it.

00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:05.480
All I care about is access
to their brains.

00:10:07.480 --> 00:10:08.980
What now?

00:10:12.070 --> 00:10:14.360
I'll go alone.

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:18.070
I'll keep tabs on your
location at all times.

00:10:18.070 --> 00:10:19.610
Thanks.

00:10:19.610 --> 00:10:23.950
Don't let your guard down.
And let us know if anything happens.

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:25.410
Got it.

00:10:47.560 --> 00:10:49.850
The readings are getting more intense.

00:10:49.850 --> 00:10:54.270
Looks like the Kunad Gate
is growing even more active.

00:11:25.720 --> 00:11:27.470
"Yuito Sumeragi"

00:11:27.470 --> 00:11:28.980
"Yuito Sumeragi"
"Kaito Sumeragi"

00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:31.440
"Yuito Sumeragi"
"Kaito Sumeragi"

00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:31.440
Doesn't look like a trap.

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:35.610
I don't have any influence
over the OSF right now.

00:11:36.820 --> 00:11:38.940
I heard you were confined to home.

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:41.990
I don't care if I'm being monitored.

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:44.660
Do not underestimate me.

00:11:49.660 --> 00:11:54.080
I <i>will </i>kill you and take
that brain of yours.

00:12:41.090 --> 00:12:42.670
Why?

00:12:42.670 --> 00:12:46.430
Why did my attempt at time travel fail?

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:52.180
Others tend to spawn in this area.

00:12:52.180 --> 00:12:54.940
Let's get this over with.

00:12:54.940 --> 00:12:58.150
Major General Fubuki must've
brought you up to speed.

00:12:58.150 --> 00:13:02.650
Yeah, you want to enter
the Sumeragi family mausoleum.

00:13:02.650 --> 00:13:04.900
Time travel?

00:13:04.900 --> 00:13:08.240
Karen took Yakumo Sumeragi's place?

00:13:08.240 --> 00:13:10.080
Don't make me laugh.

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:15.670
It's all a wild fantasy built
on circumstantial evidence.

00:13:15.670 --> 00:13:18.500
I'll take my chances.

00:13:18.500 --> 00:13:22.010
We need to eliminate the Kunad Gate.

00:13:22.010 --> 00:13:24.880
And we need your help.

00:13:24.880 --> 00:13:26.760
Don't be stupid.

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:30.510
I may have lost my authority as OSF Chief,

00:13:30.510 --> 00:13:33.140
but I'm still head of the Sumeragi family.

00:13:33.140 --> 00:13:38.020
Nothing changes the fact I must
fulfill Yakumo's dearest wish.

00:13:38.020 --> 00:13:43.820
Normally, one would think it futile to
point a weapon such as this at a psionic.

00:13:43.820 --> 00:13:48.700
However, you would never
harm your brother.

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:50.910
But I'm not like you.

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:57.370
I will fulfill my mission, even if it
means killing my own brother.

00:14:28.570 --> 00:14:30.700
Yuito's surrounded by Others!

00:14:31.700 --> 00:14:33.330
Something's coming!

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:41.130
"Intrusion Detected"

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:41.130
The Suoh OSF.

00:14:41.130 --> 00:14:43.000
They sniffed us out again!

00:14:49.470 --> 00:14:51.140
Stand back!

00:14:56.850 --> 00:14:59.560
Damn it! There're too many.

00:15:10.490 --> 00:15:11.700
Yuito!

00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:32.720
You okay, Kaito?

00:15:39.350 --> 00:15:42.060
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:15:43.060 --> 00:15:45.690
Why didn't you leave me here?

00:15:45.690 --> 00:15:48.690
You could've escaped alone.

00:15:48.690 --> 00:15:50.570
You're probably right.

00:15:51.740 --> 00:15:58.080
Oh, I see. You can't get into the
Sumeragi Mausoleum if I'm dead.

00:15:58.080 --> 00:16:01.000
Kaito and I...

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:02.870
Don't worry.

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:07.130
You are both our sons, after all.

00:16:08.210 --> 00:16:13.130
Karen taking Yakumo's place
and our time travel, it's all true.

00:16:13.130 --> 00:16:15.760
We even met Mom in the past.

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:17.470
I'm not lying.

00:16:17.470 --> 00:16:20.810
I want you to know that.

00:16:23.480 --> 00:16:29.110
You've learned much about this world.

00:16:29.110 --> 00:16:35.280
But then you should also understand how
badly New Himuka has gone wrong.

00:16:35.280 --> 00:16:39.370
But that is entirely the fault
of the moon dwellers.

00:16:39.370 --> 00:16:42.580
They created the Extinction Belt
and the Others.

00:16:42.580 --> 00:16:46.380
The people of Earth
suffered because of it.

00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:50.880
Annihilating the moon dwellers is
the Sumeragi family's sacred duty.

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:54.050
It has cost countless lives.

00:16:54.050 --> 00:16:56.220
I've even deceived the people.

00:16:56.220 --> 00:17:00.930
But it was all to avenge ourselves
for a wrong done 2,000 years ago

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:03.940
and thereby fulfill Yakumo's dearest wish.

00:17:03.940 --> 00:17:06.940
He wouldn't want that.

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:12.940
It's all meaningless if annihilating them
is going to cost so many lives.

00:17:15.240 --> 00:17:18.030
You're acting just like Togetsu.

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:22.830
You're a prisoner of what someone
you've never met said ages ago.

00:17:25.080 --> 00:17:27.790
This nation has gone wrong.

00:17:27.790 --> 00:17:32.420
And the OSF I longed to join
was keeping a dirty secret.

00:17:32.420 --> 00:17:37.550
But I still want to fight as an OSF
soldier and protect the people.

00:17:37.550 --> 00:17:39.510
That hasn't changed.

00:17:40.720 --> 00:17:44.560
I won't be a slave to someone's
2,000-year-old words.

00:17:44.560 --> 00:17:47.650
I want to build a future
of my own free will.

00:17:47.650 --> 00:17:52.110
That's what my comrades
and I have been doing so far...

00:17:52.110 --> 00:17:53.490
...and will keep doing.

00:17:55.650 --> 00:17:58.160
You must be strong, Yuito!

00:18:17.380 --> 00:18:21.050
You halted Togetsu's plan.

00:18:21.050 --> 00:18:24.930
That means you've avenged Mom's murder.

00:18:24.930 --> 00:18:29.100
I never imagined you'd exact
the vengeance I'd been seeking.

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:32.110
For that, at least, I thank you.

00:18:32.110 --> 00:18:33.530
Kaito.

00:19:04.640 --> 00:19:05.890
Yuito.

00:19:08.230 --> 00:19:11.020
It's the key to the mausoleum.

00:19:11.020 --> 00:19:14.520
This is not an admission
that you're right.

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:17.280
But if you think you are, show me!

00:19:17.280 --> 00:19:19.400
Show me what you would do!

00:19:20.530 --> 00:19:22.780
Kaito.

00:19:22.780 --> 00:19:26.660
Yuito, you must live.

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:28.080
Don't!

00:19:31.040 --> 00:19:32.500
Kaito!

00:19:34.710 --> 00:19:36.500
Prove it!

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:39.130
Show me you're the one who's right.

00:19:45.390 --> 00:19:47.060
Kaito!

00:19:48.140 --> 00:19:50.140
Outta my way!

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:55.940
Kaito!

00:20:08.120 --> 00:20:10.120
Yuito! It's not over yet!

00:20:15.090 --> 00:20:17.500
I told you not to let your guard down!

00:20:21.510 --> 00:20:23.890
Kasane! You're all here!

00:20:23.890 --> 00:20:26.600
You haven't been hurt, have you, Chief?

00:20:26.600 --> 00:20:28.260
Fubuki.

00:20:28.260 --> 00:20:30.850
What is going on?

00:20:30.850 --> 00:20:36.060
Suoh and Seiran have agreed
to a temporary ceasefire.

00:20:36.060 --> 00:20:38.070
A ceasefire?

00:20:39.150 --> 00:20:42.360
Major General Fubuki approached Seiran
about dealing with the Kunad Gate

00:20:42.360 --> 00:20:45.160
after it spun out of control.

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:48.490
Yuito is no longer being named a rebel.

00:20:48.490 --> 00:20:51.000
And Wataru is back at HQ.

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:53.710
It seems the order to
eliminate us is on hold.

00:20:53.710 --> 00:20:56.290
For now, at least.

00:20:56.290 --> 00:20:57.840
That's a relief.

00:20:57.840 --> 00:21:00.880
Still, this is no time for complacency.

00:21:00.880 --> 00:21:04.340
Yeah, the situation hangs by a thread.

00:21:07.050 --> 00:21:09.140
Careful, everyone!

00:21:27.990 --> 00:21:29.990
"Warning"

00:21:38.500 --> 00:21:40.630
Others are spawning over Suoh!

00:21:40.630 --> 00:21:42.210
I've never seen so many!

00:21:42.210 --> 00:21:47.220
And that tremor we just felt caused
an error in the defense system!

00:21:47.220 --> 00:21:51.220
Anti-Other flak cannon
performance degraded 30%!

00:22:05.990 --> 00:22:08.870
Let's get back to Suoh at once!

00:22:08.870 --> 00:22:11.830
Yeah, let's do that.

00:22:12.870 --> 00:22:14.040
Yuito?!

00:22:34.060 --> 00:22:41.900
<i>I've been a prisoner</i>
<i>of my own longing</i>

00:22:43.690 --> 00:22:51.490
<i>The shimmering heat signals me to halt</i>

00:22:51.490 --> 00:22:53.620
<i>There's a stranger in me</i>

00:22:53.620 --> 00:22:56.120
<i>I'll fly high so I won't be scared</i>

00:22:56.120 --> 00:23:01.380
<i>By this new self I've never seen</i>

00:23:01.380 --> 00:23:03.170
<i>I'm spreading my wings</i>

00:23:03.170 --> 00:23:05.510
<i>Bird in florid flight</i>

00:23:05.510 --> 00:23:10.220
<i>Lift your eyes to the scarlet sky</i>

00:23:10.220 --> 00:23:15.430
<i>Overtaken by the mighty wind</i>

00:23:15.430 --> 00:23:20.600
<i>The view unfolds upon a world</i>
<i>that begins turning</i>

00:23:20.600 --> 00:23:25.070
<i>Amid the intermingling light</i>

00:23:25.070 --> 00:23:30.950
<i>I keep searching for tomorrow</i>

00:23:30.950 --> 00:23:32.570
<i>Tomorrow's in your hands</i>

00:23:32.570 --> 00:23:35.790
<i>Don't tell me now you're afraid</i>

00:23:35.790 --> 00:23:37.410
<i>There's no time to waste</i>

00:23:37.410 --> 00:23:40.370
<i>Keep going forward</i>

00:23:40.370 --> 00:23:44.710
<i>There's nothing to be afraid of</i>

00:23:44.710 --> 00:23:46.380
<i>Now, let's go</i>

00:23:46.380 --> 00:23:51.840
<i>Into a brand-new day</i>

00:24:08.900 --> 00:24:11.910
"The Sumeragi Mausoleum"
